1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,120
Surprise, yelling is still a thing.

2
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:09,780
I was on CNN, and the other correspondent said,

3
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:13,060
everybody knows that women love

4
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:17,020
when strange men yell compliments at them in the street.

5
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:19,880
Everybody knows that.

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:24,240
That's when I decided I needed to tell him

7
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:27,480
what a compliment was, because he doesn't know that.

8
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:32,580
A compliment is words of praise.

9
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:36,500
So if I'm in Brooklyn at midnight,

10
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:43,240
and a Jamaican man appears from the shadows

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:51,320
and says, sweetness, you look like a vanilla ice cream.

12
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:55,100
I want to lick you.

13
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:59,680
That's not a compliment.

